              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye izindaba zika-Asa, nawo onke amandla akhe, nakho konke akwenzayo, nemizi ayakhayo, angithi kulotshiwe encwadini yezindaba zemihla ngemihla yamakhosi akwaJuda na? Nokho, ngesikhathi sokuguga kwakhe wayegula izinyawo.",
          "type": "text",
