              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Asa wayeselala koyise, wembelwa koyise emzini kaDavide uyise; uJehoshafati indodana yakhe waba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.",
