        },
        {
          "text": "UBaesa, indodana ka-Ahiya, wendlu ka-Isakare, wamenzela ugobe; uBhahesha wamshaya eGibethoni yamaFilisti; ngoba uNadabi loIsrayeli wonke bavimbezela iGibethoni.",
          "type": "text",
