        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho eqala ukubusa, wachitha yonke indlu kaJerobowamu; akashiyanga noyedwa ophefumulayo kuJerobowamu, waze wamchitha njengezwi likaJehova alikhuluma ngenceku yakhe u-Ahiya waseShilo.",
